<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/themes.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/mobile.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/homepage-aboutpage.css">
</head>

<body>

    <%- include('sidebar') %>

    <div class="main">
        <div class="homepage">
            <section class="hero">
                <div class="hero-background"></div>
                <div class="hero-content">
                    <h1 class="hero-title">About QuizToon</h1>
                    <p class="hero-description">Discover the story behind your favorite quiz platform</p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="about-intro">
                <div class="intro-content">
                    <h2>What is QuizToon?</h2>
                    <p>QuizToon is a modern, interactive quiz application dedicated to testing your knowledge about cartoons. Whether you're a casual cartoon fan or a devoted enthusiast, QuizToon offers an exciting platform to challenge yourself with engaging cartoon trivia questions and discover fascinating facts about your favorite animated characters and shows.</p>
                    <p>Built with modern web technologies, QuizToon combines a sleek, user-friendly interface with smooth functionality to deliver an exceptional cartoon quiz experience.</p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="about-purpose">
                <h2>Our Mission</h2>
                <div class="purpose-grid">
                    <div class="purpose-card">
                        <div class="purpose-icon">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 18 0 9 9 0 1 0-18 0"/><path d="M9 9h.01"/><path d="M15 9h.01"/><path d="M9 15a3 3 0 0 0 6 0"/></svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3>Make Learning Fun</h3>
                        <p>We believe education should be enjoyable. Every quiz is crafted to be entertaining while challenging your knowledge.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="purpose-card">
                        <div class="purpose-icon">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 17"/><polyline points="17 6 23 6 23 12"/></svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3>Track Progress</h3>
                        <p>Monitor your performance, track your scores, and see how much you've improved over time.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="purpose-card">
                        <div class="purpose-icon">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3>Challenge Yourself</h3>
                        <p>Test your limits with diverse quiz topics and difficulty levels that keep you engaged and coming back for more.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="about-features">
                <h2>What We Offer</h2>
                <div class="features-grid">
                    <div class="feature-item">
                        <div class="feature-icon">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 3H9a6 6 0 0 0 0 12h0a6 6 0 0 1 0 12h-6"/><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="3"/></svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3>Customizable Themes</h3>
                        <p>Personalize your experience with multiple themes inspired by your favorite cartoons and entertainment properties.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="feature-item">
                        <div class="feature-icon">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2z"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3>Instant Feedback</h3>
                        <p>Get immediate results and explanations for each quiz to help you learn and improve your knowledge.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="feature-item">
                        <div class="feature-icon">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"/><path d="M3 3v5h5"/><path d="M12 7v5l4 2"/></svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3>Leaderboard</h3>
                        <p>Compete with friends and other players to see who's the ultimate quiz champion!</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="feature-item">
                        <div class="feature-icon">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3>Quick Sessions</h3>
                        <p>Play at your own pace with customizable quiz lengths and difficulty settings.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="feature-item">
                        <div class="feature-icon">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3>Profile Tracking</h3>
                        <p>Save your progress and performance history. Track your improvements and revisit your favorite cartoon quizzes anytime.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="about-team">
                <div class="team-values">
                    <h2>Our Values</h2>
                    <div class="value-card">
                        <h3>Innovation</h3>
                        <p>We continuously explore new technologies and approaches to deliver cutting-edge features.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="value-card">
                        <h3>Quality</h3>
                        <p>Every detail matters. We obsess over code quality, design, and user experience.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="value-card">
                        <h3>Community</h3>
                        <p>We build for our users and value their feedback to constantly improve the platform.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <h2>About Our Team</h2>
                <div class="team-intro">
                    <p>QuizToon was created by a dedicated group of developers from <strong>Group 1</strong> who are passionate about creating engaging digital experiences. Our team combines expertise in web development, design, and user experience to build applications that people genuinely enjoy using.</p> <br>
                    <div class="team-members">
                        <p><strong>Group Members:</strong></p>
                        <p>Clarence Jerald G. Luna</p>
                        <p>Kevenly H. Luistro</p>
                        <p>Christian Patrick T. Panti</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="quick-start">
                <div class="quick-start-content">
                    <h2>Ready to Test Your Knowledge?</h2>
                    <p>Join thousands of quiz enthusiasts and start your journey with QuizToon today.</p>
                    <a href="/quiz" class="btn-cta">Start Your First Quiz</a>
                </div>
            </section>

            <footer class="simple-footer">
                <div class="footer-main">
                    <p>Made with <strong>❤︎</strong> by Group 1</p>
                    <div class="credits">
                        <span>Clarence Jerald G. Luna</span>
                        <span>Kevenly H. Luistro</span>
                        <span>Christian Patrick T. Panti</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="footer-copyright">
                    <span>© 2026 QuizToon. All rights reserved.</span>
                </div>
            </footer>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="/js/ui.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
